// rendering: the frames were 100% `Locus.recompute`. So the same sweep
// run on optimized dart2js and dart2wasm says whether that gap is the
// engine or the debug compiler.
//
// Run: bash benchmark/run_locus_docs.sh
//
// ignore_for_file: avoid_print
